			"date": "2023-10-20T19:47:35.529Z",
			"content": "<p>Just to be clear, this adds ESM support to all JavaScript files in <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span>:</p><p>• Configuration Files<br />• JavaScript Data Files (Global, Directory, or Template)<br />• `.11ty.js` (and `.11ty.mjs`) Template Files<br />• and importantly we will not require you to upgrade your projects to ESM either. Eleventy 3.0 will continue to support CommonJS Eleventy projects.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
